  "chosen: nobody picked these to make a number look good. Only the",
  "computed `context` is kept — no names, no owners, nothing about a",
  "person.",
  "",
  "It is a SAMPLE, not a census, and it is here to answer questions about",
  "breadth. The thresholds the build enforces are measured on the seed."
